data: {"id": "bfae721e95b240a0-thinking-parallel_evidence-1540", "run_id": "bfae721e95b240a0", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n- **Pod 身份与生命周期**: `aiops-case-v15/workload`，UID `da351bf0-c4ab-47a0-b24d-7c7a75950753`，运行在 `node2`，单容器 `app`，镜像 `python:3-alpine`，`restartPolicy: Always`。\n- **当前状态**: Phase=Running，但容器 `app` 未 Ready，WaitingReason=CrashLoopBackOff，RestartCount=16，Exit Code=137。\n- **Last State**: Terminated，Reason=**OOMKilled**，Exit Code=137。最后一次运行仅持续约 1 秒（Started 10:23:38 → Finished 10:23:39）。\n- **Command/Args**: `python3 -u -c \"import time; print('startup allocation 256Mi', flush=True); memory=bytearr", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789381508647, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

